Simple Number Guessing Application
what it does:
- prompts user to guess the number the computer picks
- includes ability to select difficulty levels and custom range level
- includes stats menu that shows stats for specific difficulty games and overall stats
- when answer is incorrect, console will either share whether guess is too high or too low
- when answer is correct, user will be given number of attempts made

what it will have later:
- will have gui features
- achievements